// Wide calls (docs/design/Calls030.md, Lowering and artifacts): a call of
// a function with 300 parameters with every argument named, in parameter
// order and reversed; a call that leaves 299 parameters to their defaults;
// and an interpolated string with 300 holes. More than 255 argument words
// stay correct: tier 2 declines such an exit and the interpreter runs it.
// The first argument picks the case:
//   order    300 named arguments in parameter order
//   reverse  300 named arguments in reverse order
//   defaults one argument and 299 defaults
//   holes    an interpolated string with 300 holes
//   all      every case above
// tests/backend/tier_programs_tests.cpp runs it at every tier.
